"Insomnia quits %@ and opens it again with the two flags that stop it throttling hidden windows. Your windows and tabs come back only if %@ is set to reopen them on startup. If %@ has not quit after %lld s, nothing is relaunched." = "Insomnia 会退出 %@，再用两个阻止其限流隐藏窗口的参数重新打开它。只有当 %@ 被设置为启动时恢复窗口，你的窗口和标签页才会回来。如果 %@ 在 %lld 秒后仍未退出，则不会重启任何东西。";

